5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to understand the history of conflicts in the bike area before we decide anything.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m curious if the current spots actually match where people park. It feels a bit unfair if the same doors always get the good ones!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to verify if the physical layout is causing the morning congestion.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m tired of guessing. I need to know the actual cash flow and what a household pays when they’re stuck outside.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to see what the last two maintenance roles actually required. I want to know the real workload before we assign anyone.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, if the spots don't match reality, we need to know who is actually using them.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, exactly! I want to see if the daily riders match the assigned spots. It feels like a mystery to me!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the cash flow is important, but I suspect the physical bottlenecks are the root cause of the morning chaos.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, bottlenecks are symptoms. I need the root cause: the money. Who is actually paying for this mess?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, money is important, but without knowing the physical effort, the role will just be abandoned again.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, if the role is abandoned, the conflict returns. I need to see the complaint log to understand the pattern.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I agree! The complaint log might show if the grumbling is real or just noise. I want to see the pattern too!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the log shows symptoms, not causes. I need to see the actual morning departures to understand the flow.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, watching people leave is anecdotal. I need the ledger to see if we are actually bleeding money or just complaining about it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the ledger shows the past, not the future. I need to know the physical reality of the rows to assess the effort.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the last year's complaint log entries and the five years of association minutes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I will look into the sticker register and the daily riders, and the morning departures watched from the entrance.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into the morning departures watched from the entrance and the rain exposure along the parking rows.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will look into the building account's two-year ledger and the Treasurer's handover file on cash collections.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the five years of association minutes and the rain exposure along the parking rows.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
